    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> is always with you, and you have a knack for succeeding even when the odds are against you.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can spend <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>, even if it is not your turn. All other restrictions to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> use still apply.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Unless otherwise specified, you can spend <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> only on your turn, preventing you from enhancing attacks and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a> made as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>.</p>",
